# ---- SpaceCommsKit repo ignore rules (added 11/2026) ----

# SECRETS -- never commit. security.h holds the AES-128 keys the Ground
# Station patches in at build time; any .hex/.out built after patching
# contains those keys too.
**/security.h
**/sck2400_merged.hex
CCS_SCK-2400/sck2400_firmware/*.hex

# CCS / TI build output
**/Debug/
**/Release/
*.o
*.obj
*.out
*.map
*.d
**/.clangd/

# Visual Studio / .NET build output
**/.vs/
**/bin/
**/obj/
*.user

# Editor / OS clutter
*.bak
*.orig
*.pre_*
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# Build output folders (added 11/10)
CCS_SCK-2400/sck2400_firmware/V3/
CCS_SCK-2400/sck2400_bim/V3/*
!CCS_SCK-2400/sck2400_bim/V3/sck2400_bim.hex
**/*.sckbuild
*.diff
